  "details": "Some relevant information.\n\n* Local lag from Cloth/DynamicBone/ParticleSystem\n\n* World fixed joint\n\n* UI avatar refresh bug. Fix your parsing. :)\n\nSo lets begin. Please developers we have a lot of requests and posts, some of these posts have over a thousand upvotes ive heard, and we still dont get a damn update or fix. World fixed joints broke at the update to 2017. Local lag has existed for months and you guys dont care. UI avatar refresh bug has existed for god knows how long.\n\nPlease update your developers software so that they can understand human language and listen to the creator community.\n\nTL;DR Please just start listening to us we are tired of you guys saying \"oh we're working on it\" when we have been asking for months and months but you guys would rather publish a new home world and a new loading avatar???\n\nPs: I think fixing your already existing broken problems, are more improtant than saying \"hurr durr\" LTS 2018 and \"hurr durr\" lets go Oculus Quest! I think bugs from months and months ago take priority. Btw i predict this post will be removed cause it's too true.",
